---
import SimpleLayout from "../../layouts/SimpleLayout.astro";

const description = "Privacy Policy for Password Game : Duel.";
---

<SimpleLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Password Game : Duel"
  description={description}
  robots="index, follow"
  themeColor="#12002b"
>
  <main id="main" class="legal-page">
    <article class="legal-card">
      <p class="legal-kicker">Password Game : Duel</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-date">Last updated: April 22, 2026</p>

      <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
      <p>Bubble App Studio — contact@bubbleappstudio.xyz</p>

      <h2>2. Data we collect</h2>
      <p>
        The app does not require an account and Bubble App Studio does not operate servers
        that store your gameplay videos or personal content.
      </p>
      <p>
        Password Game : Duel may access the camera, microphone, and screen recording features
        only to let you play, record a round, and export or share the result if you choose to.
        Recordings stay on your device unless you decide to save or share them.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Analytics and attribution</h2>
      <p>
        We use AppsFlyer to measure basic app performance and acquisition attribution, such as
        first launch, app launch, round started, round completed, and video export events.
        We do not request App Tracking Transparency permission, we do not access the IDFA,
        and we do not serve targeted advertising in the app.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Purchases</h2>
      <p>
        If the app is purchased through the App Store, the transaction is processed by Apple.
        Bubble App Studio does not receive or store your payment card details.
      </p>

      <h2>5. How we use data</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Provide the local gameplay and video export experience.</li>
        <li>Understand whether the app launches and whether core gameplay works.</li>
        <li>Measure marketing performance without selling your data.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell your data.</p>

      <h2>6. Retention</h2>
      <p>
        Gameplay recordings are controlled by you on your device. Analytics and attribution data
        may be retained by AppsFlyer and Apple under their respective policies.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        For privacy questions or data requests, contact us at contact@bubbleappstudio.xyz.
        For App Store purchase questions, refer to your Apple account and App Store settings.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The online version prevails.</p>
    </article>
  </main>

  <style>
    :global(body) {
      background:
        radial-gradient(760px 520px at 50% 0%, rgba(98, 0, 255, 0.3), transparent 64%),
        radial-gradient(680px 460px at 85% 90%, rgba(216, 255, 0, 0.12), transparent 66%),
        #070010;
    }

    :global(body)::before {
      opacity: 0.08;
    }

    .legal-page {
      min-height: 100dvh;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      padding: clamp(28px, 6vw, 72px);
    }

    .legal-card {
      width: min(900px, 100%);
      background: rgba(12, 0, 31, 0.72);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 48px);
      box-shadow:
        0 24px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),
        0 0 48px rgba(98, 0, 255, 0.14);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    }

    .legal-kicker {
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.28em;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: #d8ff00;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
    }

    .legal-date {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.58);
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 54px);
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-family: "SF Pro Rounded", "SF Pro Display", "SF Pro Text", -apple-system,
        BlinkMacSystemFont, "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    }

    h2 {
      margin-top: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 1.08rem;
      color: #f5f0ff;
    }

    p,
    li {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    ul {
      padding-left: 20px;
      margin-top: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    a {
      color: #d8ff00;
      text-underline-offset: 4px;
    }
  </style>
</SimpleLayout>
